     * `pros`, `cons`, `reasonsForChoosing`, `reasonsForSwitching` with `alternativesConsidered` /
     * `switchedFrom`, `advice`, the incentive badges (`incentive`, `incentivized`,
     * `vendorReferred`, `reviewSource`), `source` (Capterra, GetApp or Software Advice) and
     * `vendorResponse`. Pages through Capterra's review pages up to `max_results` (25 per page, at
     * most 100 pages, in Capterra's "Most Helpful" order). A product with only a few reviews has
